^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ template arguments: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ run time: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
